      "id": 4,
      "claim": "The equation representing the total number of students is 3x + 20 = 200.",
      "evidence": "Simplifying the expression from step 3 (x + x + 10 + x + 10 = 3x + 20) and equating it to the given total of 200 students.",
      "weight": 0.20,
